      en: ["Subject of a major rescue archaeology project", "Submerged by the El Cajón Dam in the 1980s", "Located in the Sulaco and Humuya river basins", "Evidence of occupation from 1000 BC to 1500 AD", "Revealed trade links with the Maya civilization", "Artifacts are preserved in national museums"]
